@* The default layout: a schema that declares search fields adds the search field, next to the result count and the refresh button. Search "umbrella" (the customer) or "overdue"
   (the status), in any case and without accents. Searching goes back to the first page and replaces the address (find.q) instead of adding an entry, so Back leaves the page
   rather than replaying every keystroke; a search that matches nothing offers to clear itself. *@
<div class="w-full" data-testid="list-search">
    <BxDataList TItem="Invoice" Label="Invoices with search" Schema="InvoiceData.Schema" Items="InvoiceData.All" UrlKey="find" ResultJson="DemoJson.Default.DataListResultInvoice" />
</div>
